OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy day with a
OL,6,Fscattering of light showers
OL,7,Fdeveloping. However the odd brighter
OL,8,Fspell may break through during the
OL,9,Fafternoon, most likely towards
OL,10,FDeeside. Winds light from the west to
OL,11,Fnorthwest.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FContinuing with mainly cloudy
OL,14,Fskies which occasionally thicken to
OL,15,Fbring a few light drizzly showers.
OL,16,FWinds light and variable in direction.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
