OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloudy for much of the day,
OL,6,Fwith a few light showers developing.
OL,7,FSome chance of brighter spells
OL,8,Fappearing later in the day. Winds
OL,9,Flight.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FMainly
OL,12,Fcloudy with some patchy light rain and
OL,13,Fdrizzle, always focused around the
OL,14,Feast coast and most persistent on
OL,15,FThursday. Winds light. Early frost and
OL,16,Fpossibily fog patches in west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
